'''Sister Lione''' (獅子姉妹 ''Shishi Shimai'', '''Sister Lion''') is a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy introduced in [[Another New Year (Monthly Event)|Another New Year]]. She was added in [[Version 8.0 Update|Version 8.0]].

