==Enemy==
She is slower than the original [[Mooth]], but she has higher health, longer range, and the ability to weaken Cat Units. She loses the 1-knockback characteristic of most of Mooth's variants, having 5 knockbacks instead.

==Strategy==
Using [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Kotatsu Cat]] is a very viable strategy to stall and weaken Sister Lione. Also, [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Lizard Cat]] and [[Crazed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Lizard Cat]] both outrange Sister Lione by 25. Thus, they should be able to quickly deal with her when paired with Kotatsu Cat. She normally acts as support, hiding behind the frontlines. Therefore, [[:Category:Long Distance Cats|Long Distance Cats]] or [[:Category:Wave Attack Cats|Wave Attack Cats]] can focus on her while other units deal with the front.

