==Trivia==
*Her Japanese name, Shishi Shimai (獅子姉妹, "Lion Sister" or "Sister Lion") continues the theme of repeated syllables in [[Mooth]] variants' Japanese names, saying "Shi" three times in two different words. It also sounds much like 獅子舞 ''shishimai'', meaning [[wikipedia:Lion dance|lion dance]].
*She is the only variant of Mooth to have a visible moving mouth.

